OL,3,GNEWSADaniel Thomas jailed for 15 months
OL,4,Afor slashing dinghy                    
OL,6,FHis barrister argued it was an act of  
OL,7,F"performative activism" rather than a  
OL,8,F"political crime" and said nobody had  
OL,9,Fbeen put in danger.                    
